5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"We need to stop guessing. Before we pick a system, we need to know the actual time cost. I want to measure a full pass.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I agree with Ryuji. I also want to check the wall calendar to see who is actually here, because fairness matters to me.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I want to review the house chat logs. I need to understand how our conflicts actually start before we lock in a year-long system.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to check the bathroom spray receipts and the management office rate sheet. I need to know exactly what we spend and who pays first!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I should look at what everyone counts as done. And maybe the grout? I just want to know what to expect.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I’ll also check the outside firm’s terms. I need to know if paying them actually removes the time burden or just shifts it.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,I’ll also check the kitchen watch. I need to see who actually uses it versus who cleans it.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I’ll also look at the previous tenants’ note. I need to see if their permanent split actually worked, or if it just broke the house.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I’ll also check the stopwatch timing! I need to know exactly how long a full clean takes so I can figure out the real monthly cost.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I’ll also look at the bathroom grout. I just want to know how long it stays clean, so I can stop dreading it.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
