35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The timing shows one hundred and two minutes total. The firm’s terms require someone to be present and tidy beforehand. It does not remove the burden.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mio,,"The calendar shows two people away most months, and one was gone all August. The kitchen mess comes from just two or three of us cooking.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The chat shows our fights start with reminders. The previous tenants’ permanent split left them barely speaking. I fear that silence.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Okay! The spray costs 2,300 yen monthly, but we buy it twice! The full clean takes 102 minutes. That’s a lot of time!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I found out that ""done"" means different things to everyone. Also, the grout gets dirty again in just eleven days. It feels impossible to keep up.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, the absence data confirms the workload is uneven. @Rin, the 102 minutes is the baseline. We need a system that accounts for who is actually present.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, exactly! The calendar proves it. And the kitchen watch shows only a few of us actually cook. We can’t charge everyone equally for that.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, the previous tenants’ silence confirms my fear. A permanent split isolates us. We need a system that keeps us talking, not just cleaning.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, 102 minutes is huge! If we pay 4,200 yen an hour, that’s over 7,000 yen! Plus the 2,300 yen for spray. Who pays first?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Rin, I’m sorry. The grout returning in eleven days is... discouraging. I just want to know what to expect when I walk in.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, the grout issue is a ventilation problem, not a cleaning failure. @Victoria, the firm’s terms mean we still do the prep work. It doesn’t solve the time cost.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, true, but the kitchen data shows the mess is concentrated. If we pay, we still need someone to tidy up before they arrive.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, the prep work is the trap. If we pay, we still have to coordinate who is home to let them in. That coordination is where the friction lives.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Victoria, the coordination is the problem! If we pay, who chases the money? I need to know who is out of pocket before we agree!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Rin, I don’t know who pays first. I just need the rooms to be predictable. If the grout is always dirty, I can’t relax.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Rin, the invoice goes to one named tenant. @Daisuke, the grout is a ventilation flaw, not a cleaning failure. We need a system that accounts for both.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Rin, the invoice goes to one person, but we split it. @Daisuke, the grout is a ventilation flaw, not a cleaning failure. We need a system that accounts for both.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Rin, the invoice goes to one person, but we split it. @Daisuke, the grout is a ventilation flaw, not a cleaning failure. We need a system that accounts for both.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Ryuji, @Mio, @Victoria, wait! If the invoice goes to one person, that person is out of pocket! I need to know who that is and how we settle up!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mio"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Rin, I understand the worry. But the grout returning in eleven days is a ventilation flaw, not a cleaning failure. We need a system that accounts for both.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
