66,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, the hours stay the same, but the fairness changes. If I’m away, I shouldn’t clean. A rota lets us skip, which is what I need.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, the hours may stay, but the friction changes. A rota keeps us interacting. Standing assignments isolate us, like the previous tenants. I cannot risk that silence.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
